{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:11:58.626Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-context-ci6v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Context relevance re-ranker with usage-affinity learning loop"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:11:58.626Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:11:58.626Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-agent"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"0aa7f2478b1985e9d42f5d2121e8aedba07c552bd411dfbb2bd08afdad979dc5","message":""}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:12:05.166Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:12:05.166Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:12:05.165Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Design: register governed context_relevance service override that nudges pm's default ranking with a recency-decayed usage affinity derived from an append-only JSONL ledger at runtime/context-usage.jsonl. Auto-touch loop reads previous serve row + history/*.jsonl (ts field) to record touches for served items mutated since the last serve. New pm context-usage command for inspection/manual touch/reset. Fail-open returns undefined on any error."}]}],"before_hash":"0aa7f2478b1985e9d42f5d2121e8aedba07c552bd411dfbb2bd08afdad979dc5","after_hash":"28c868b016fad5bd0d01d6a2166cabb4f7a34f64bef0001b93996a9e533119b6"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:12:11.002Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:12:11.002Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Acceptance criteria: (1) context_relevance service registered via api.registerService returning {id,score}[] for every candidate. (2) Ledger at runtime/context-usage.jsonl bounded to 2000 rows, corrupt lines skipped. (3) Affinity in [0,1], neutral for unseen items, served-but-untouched below unserved. (4) Auto-touch from previous serve row + history ts. (5) pm context-usage command with --report/--touch/--reset/--json/--limit/--pm-path. (6) Fail-open returns undefined, never throws. (7) 100% coverage of new code. (8) manifest.json services capability added. (9) Four functional proofs in /tmp workspace."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:12:11.002Z"}],"before_hash":"28c868b016fad5bd0d01d6a2166cabb4f7a34f64bef0001b93996a9e533119b6","after_hash":"94fd44bd4978e86fcb8fb20e6ab235dcf5074c7635f99eb98b5aa382dddba4f5"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:40:28.852Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:40:28.852Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm context-usage: report which served context an agent actually used"}],"before_hash":"94fd44bd4978e86fcb8fb20e6ab235dcf5074c7635f99eb98b5aa382dddba4f5","after_hash":"1b6e2783a020c184415592966497c2ca8a7f32e61e64d281bbf16f635d20f084"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.163Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.163Z","author":"claude","text":"SCOPE CHANGE. The original design (a governed context_relevance service override plus a hand-rolled usage ledger) was discarded before implementation because it duplicated and would have corrupted shipped pm behaviour. pm 2026.7.25 already maintains runtime/context-usage.jsonl itself and already folds it into the usage_affinity signal of its built-in relevance model. The discarded draft wrote to that exact filename with an incompatible row schema ({t,at,id} vs pms {kind,at,author,item_id,intent}), so two writers with two schemas would have silently corrupted the signal both depend on."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.163Z"}],"before_hash":"1b6e2783a020c184415592966497c2ca8a7f32e61e64d281bbf16f635d20f084","after_hash":"23653030de8656f54164a1ee63ad66aa9a4fa689dd136c6de4aa1afec740047d"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.469Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.468Z","author":"claude","text":"DELIVERED: read-only pm context-usage. Reports serve-then-touch conversion, waste (served but never touched = context paid for and unused) and misses (touched but never served = ranking failed to surface it), plus a per-item rollup. Deliberately does NOT compute a competing affinity score: pm owns the decay model, and a second implementation could silently disagree with the ranking it claims to explain. Flags: --author --surface --since --limit --format; the global --json is honoured."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.469Z"}],"before_hash":"23653030de8656f54164a1ee63ad66aa9a4fa689dd136c6de4aa1afec740047d","after_hash":"907d28cbf441b5dff68705880410cfce64fa892b52cca148348af8503bb9d98a"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.780Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.780Z","author":"claude","text":"Acceptance: (1) 100/100/100/100 coverage on context-usage.ts via c8. (2) Registration and command execution tested through the SDKs own host harness (activateExtensionForTest / createExtensionTestHarness) instead of hand-built api doubles, so manifest capability governance is enforced in tests. (3) Verified against the real CLI on a live tracker: 33.3% conversion, 3 waste items, filters and rc=2 usage errors all correct. (4) index.ts api/ctx now typed with SDK ExtensionApi and CommandHandlerContext instead of any."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:40:29.780Z"}],"before_hash":"907d28cbf441b5dff68705880410cfce64fa892b52cca148348af8503bb9d98a","after_hash":"26a9b294048e1b1f6e4f4b4bc473812b0430e8c204a1dbd82ceb077244523849"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:40:30.131Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:40:30.130Z","author":"claude","text":"Upstream issues filed from this work: pm-cli#717 (extensions cannot import the runtime SDK; ExtensionCommandSdk is the right mechanism but omits the derived-state readers) and pm-cli#719 (extension flags colliding with a pm global flag are silently shadowed - found by real-CLI testing after unit tests passed against a permissive double)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:40:30.131Z"}],"before_hash":"26a9b294048e1b1f6e4f4b4bc473812b0430e8c204a1dbd82ceb077244523849","after_hash":"4ac9c72e5875edf8901468e6b6ee04f8829148f202237f86f35c48021629beaf"}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T23:54:38.056Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:54:38.056Z","author":"claude","text":"CodeRabbit review round 1 found two real defects, both fixed. P1: serves counted every ranked row, so an item pm ranked but cut from the pack was reported as waste - contradicting the modules own stated semantics, and my test had codified the wrong result. Now serves counts only included rows and a separate ranked column exposes budget losses (ranked - serves). P2: parseLedgerLine validated at as a string only, while every window filter, bound and conversion check compares timestamps lexically; \"...00.500Z\" sorts BEFORE \"...00Z\" because . precedes Z, so a non-canonical spelling silently inverted chronological order. Now requires canonical toISOString form."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-25T23:54:38.056Z"}],"before_hash":"4ac9c72e5875edf8901468e6b6ee04f8829148f202237f86f35c48021629beaf","after_hash":"9981f040bc4ea1a3651637dec210b437a42d6955aa01bd01d717ee37993495d6"}
